# Optional. The backend's ClaudeSDKClient shells out to a bundled Claude
# Code CLI, which resolves credentials exactly like the CLI itself does:
# if ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set here, it's used (metered billing, takes
# precedence over everything else). Leave it blank/unset to use this
# machine's existing Claude Code / claude.ai subscription login instead
# (run `claude` once to log in if you haven't) — no code change needed,
# just don't set this. Get a metered key at https://platform.claude.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
